            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-gif-frame-count>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-gif-min-resolution-px>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-encrinus-liliiformis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-k-at-sigma-max-over-k-c>,
